      "createdAt": 1783522876618,
      "changelog": "SanctifAI Trust Proof-of-Human attestation integration is now available:\n\n- Provides cryptographic proof that a human performed a task without exposing raw task data.\n- Supports two integration paths: embedded (default, backend API key required) and extension (for external workforces).\n- Requires fixed 3-letter taxonomy codes for `task_type` and `domain`; descriptive strings are rejected.\n- Attestation records return a participation ID and certificate URL; only hashes and select metadata are stored or published.\n- Credentials (tenant ID, API key) must be obtained from the SanctifAI Console; do not guess or fabricate values.",
      "changelogSource": "auto"
    }
